+config LEDS_LM8502
+	tristate "LED support for the LM8502 lighting driver"
+	depends on LEDS_CLASS
+	depends on I2C && OF
+	help
+	  This option enables support for the LED outputs of the LM8502
+	  lighting driver, which lights the two LEDs of the Home button of
+	  the HP TouchPad.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
+	  will be called leds-lm8502.
+
